@startuml Audit Log Query

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

actor Client
participant GatewayService
participant IngressService
participant AuditController
participant TradeAuditLogRepository
database MongoDB

Client -> GatewayService: GET /api/audit/trades\n?page=0&size=50
activate GatewayService

GatewayService -> IngressService: Route request
activate IngressService

IngressService -> IngressService: Circuit breaker check
activate IngressService
deactivate IngressService

IngressService -> AuditController: GET /api/audit/trades\n?page=0&size=50
activate AuditController

AuditController -> TradeAuditLogRepository: findAll(pageable)\n(Sort by timestamp DESC)
activate TradeAuditLogRepository

TradeAuditLogRepository -> MongoDB: FIND with pagination\nSORT by timestamp DESC
MongoDB --> TradeAuditLogRepository: Page<TradeAuditLog>
TradeAuditLogRepository --> AuditController: Page<TradeAuditLog>
deactivate TradeAuditLogRepository

loop For each audit log
    AuditController -> AuditController: convertToDto(auditLog)
    activate AuditController
    note right: Extract fields from payload:\n- bookId\n- counterPartyId\n- maturityDate\n- expired\n- createdDate\n- lastUpdatedAt
    AuditController --> AuditController: AuditDto
    deactivate AuditController
end

AuditController --> IngressService: Page<AuditDto>
deactivate AuditController

IngressService --> GatewayService: Page<AuditDto>
deactivate IngressService

GatewayService --> Client: 200 OK\nPage<AuditDto>
deactivate GatewayService

@enduml

